<h3>What was solved — the ten problems</h3>
<p>Per OpenAI's announcement, all ten are problems whose <strong>main result had seen no progress for at least ten years</strong>, across high-dimensional geometry, coding theory, arithmetic circuit complexity, group theory, operator algebras, quantum complexity, lattice cryptography and extremal combinatorics.</p>

